# Separate git checkouts living inside this tree. Committing them with `git add -A`
# would record a broken gitlink (a submodule entry with no .gitmodules), not their files.
# jetAnalysis is 445 MB and holds CSVs above GitHub's file size limit.
/RooUnfold_build_test/
/jetAnalysis/
